  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Gantt Chart control is a project management tool for visualizing and managing project schedules. It supports features like task dependencies, critical path, baseline, resource allocation, milestones, task labels, zooming, timeline views (day, week, month, year), drag-and-drop task scheduling, editing, filtering, sorting, and exporting to PDF and Excel. It is ideal for project planning, resource management, and timeline visualization in enterprise ASP.NET Core applications.",
